            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tampilkan panjang list ini di konsol agar menghasilkan <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"square_meters = [\" /><text value=\"55\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"67\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(len(square_meters))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"55\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>len</code>, dan terakhir <code>square_meters</code>.</p></body></html>"
