            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi pernyataan kondisional dengan memeriksa apakah panjang <code>ingredients</code> lebih besar dari <code>10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;lemon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Cream&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" len(ingredients) &gt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bring a bag!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>&gt;</code>, diikuti oleh <code>10</code>, dan terakhir <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi pernyataan kondisional dengan memeriksa apakah panjang <code>ingredients</code> lebih besar dari <code>10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;lemon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Cream&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" len(ingredients) &gt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bring a bag!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>&gt;</code>, diikuti oleh <code>10</code>, dan terakhir <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
